[Round 2/3 | Implementer | 79.5s | 0/400k] The current round-2 code still walks every occupancy word on every enqueue and dequeue. I’m replacing that common SPSC path with a monotonic ring window: enqueue advances a producer position, dequeue inspects only the live window for the minimum, and it falls back to the authoritative slot/bitmap scan when holes or wrap reuse make the ring window unsafe. This keeps the existing multi-handle behavior and ABI paths intact.
